# =====================================================================
# H. DGA DETECTOR — POST /api/v2/dga-detect   (entropy heuristic)
# =====================================================================

### H1. Legitimate domain
# Expect: HTTP 200
# prediction "legit", is_threat false, threat_score 0.0, features.entropy 1.918.
