# M. LEGACY ANALYSIS ENDPOINTS (called by backend mlService.js)
#    All of these send a prompt to the in-Space LLM (Qwen3.5-2B) and wrap
#    its text. Each takes about
#    7-18 s. The model handles one request at a time. risk_score here is on a
#    0–10 scale, not 0–100, and is read from the answer's "Risk Level: X" line.
#    If no LLM answers, the reply is the ML/keyword fallback: model_used
